# 7. MISROUTE 核心 process estimand

公开实现核心指标：

cross_condition_distance

neutral_drift

process_excess

process_ratio

形式：

ProcessExcess =
mean distance(condition, neutral)
-
mean distance(neutral_i, neutral_j)

